## 🌐 Idea 2: Multi-Language Support
**Priority:** #2
**Status:** Not Started
**Description:** Support Hindi, Urdu, Arabic, mixed-language (Hinglish) text formatting. Gemini 2.5 Flash already supports multilingual — needs prompt rules + RTL layout support + Unicode font handling in exports.

